1
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,290
*Itipiso Bhagavā...* (sacred chant)

2
00:00:05,290 --> 00:00:09,500
Please let our views go up. May all the merit I've built up my whole life keep my boss from yelling at me.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,850
Please don't let me have to go back home to herd buffaloes.

4
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:16,100
I'm going to disband!

5
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:16,660
Hey!

6
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,400
I'm going to disband!

7
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,230
Hey!

8
00:00:18,950 --> 00:00:21,280
I'm staying with you, Boss!

9
00:00:21,280 --> 00:00:23,110
I'll stay and keep fighting by your side, Boss!

10
00:00:23,110 --> 00:00:26,320
Jeng...

11
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:32,560
Amen.

12
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:37,330
If I still have any good karma left, may the power of the Triple Gem grant me a miracle...

13
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:38,710
...to find a new member.

14
00:00:38,710 --> 00:00:41,320
Please, let a miracle happen!

15
00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:44,460
Great job!

16
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:50,950
5, 6, 7, 8... 5 into 6, into 7...

17
00:00:50,950 --> 00:00:53,920
Awesome, girl!

18
00:00:54,440 --> 00:00:56,440
Wow, so handsome!

19
00:00:56,800 --> 00:01:01,480
Here comes the left lane! Met up with the series' male lead, Jongjong! Wow!

20
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:03,950
And on the right lane, he's a bad boy, but that's totally fine!

21
00:01:03,950 --> 00:01:07,650
It's Zae! Oh, he takes a red shot and passes it! Wow!

22
00:01:08,450 --> 00:01:10,700
Oh my god!

23
00:01:10,980 --> 00:01:13,240
Someone jumped off the building!

24
00:01:13,760 --> 00:01:15,170
I wanna die!

25
00:01:15,170 --> 00:01:18,450
What?! Someone jumped?!

26
00:01:21,840 --> 00:01:27,000
[ ♪ Loving... loving you with all my heart ♪ ]

27
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:33,080
Damn, who's that? Such a great voice!
[ ♪ Keeping those feelings locked deep inside ♪ ]

28
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:36,990
[ ♪ Can you hear me, my dear? ♪ ]

29
00:01:36,990 --> 00:01:40,640
It's a song I once wrote for someone.

30
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:43,350
Someone I used to hide my feelings for deep inside.

31
00:01:43,350 --> 00:01:51,130
[ ♪ Stuck in a loop, so every day I wake up seeing those eyes ♪ ]

32
00:01:51,130 --> 00:01:58,680
[ ♪ No matter how many lifetimes come, I pray it's always you ♪ ]

33
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:05,860
[ ♪ If wishes were real, I'd want to loop like this forever ♪ ]

34
00:02:05,860 --> 00:02:10,020
[ ♪ Could it... be you? ♪ ]

35
00:02:10,020 --> 00:02:17,110
[ ♪ No matter how far the road is, whenever it is, it's still you ♪ ]

36
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:42,280
Time to go home.

37
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:44,450
Don't be naughty.

38
00:02:45,340 --> 00:02:48,300
Hope we meet again.

39
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:54,600
Hello, Hia.

40
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,550
I agree to help you.

41
00:02:57,550 --> 00:03:04,860
Why don't you try opening your heart? Who knows, one day you might fall in love with it.

42
00:03:05,490 --> 00:03:07,520
Will it really be good?

43
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:10,380
Bitter melon...

44
00:03:10,380 --> 00:03:11,400
Bitter melon love...

45
00:03:12,330 --> 00:03:15,110
Hey, "Ma-Ra, Ma-Rak"!

46
00:03:15,110 --> 00:03:18,420
Rose apples were a hit, mangosteens were a hit...

47
00:03:18,420 --> 00:03:20,570
I think it's time for bitter melon!

48
00:03:20,570 --> 00:03:22,960
Ahh Wolf!

49
00:03:33,960 --> 00:03:35,540
Our band, Ahh Wolf...

50
00:03:35,540 --> 00:03:38,600
...is gonna be huge!

51
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:44,040
There's no way you could come up with something like this, Bai Liu!

52
00:03:46,640 --> 00:03:50,620
Hey, pack these up for me! Wrap them up!

53
00:03:50,620 --> 00:03:53,510
Here, swipe this.

54
00:03:53,510 --> 00:03:57,110
Everyone has their own taste, not just you.

55
00:03:57,110 --> 00:04:05,470
Oh my! I'll take this one, this one, and this one. In fact, give me 10 of everything in the store! Send the bill to my label!

56
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:07,320
Whoa! Oh my god!

57
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:12,560
It's blowing up! It's definitely a hit! Look, the views just surpassed 100k!

58
00:04:12,560 --> 00:04:16,399
I'm scared I'm gonna be a terrible leader.

59
00:04:16,399 --> 00:04:18,339
Our band was already about to fail...

60
00:04:18,339 --> 00:04:20,990
...and now it's gonna fail even harder.

61
00:04:20,990 --> 00:04:28,290
[ ♪ Just looking into your eyes makes me almost lose my mind, daydreaming about you every night ♪ ]

62
00:04:28,290 --> 00:04:30,290
It's out!
[ ♪ Just looking into your eyes makes me almost lose my mind, daydreaming about you every night ♪ ]

63
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,820
[ ♪ Be happy to... ♪ ]

64
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:42,710
[ ♪ Oh, do you eat bitter melon? But I don't wanna stop... ♪ ]

65
00:04:42,710 --> 00:04:46,980
[ ♪ Don't wanna take my eyes off you, I'm going crazy over... ♪ ]

66
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:53,260
[ ♪ Oh, is your name Google? 'Cause you have all the answers ♪ ]

67
00:04:53,260 --> 00:04:55,010
[ ♪ All my answers lead to you ♪ ]

68
00:04:55,010 --> 00:04:58,420
Whatever happens, happens!
[ ♪ I'm flustered because of... (you) ♪ ]

69
00:05:02,810 --> 00:05:04,600
[ ♪ Be happy to... ♪ ]

70
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:10,230
[ ♪ Oh, do you eat bitter melon? But I don't wanna stop... ♪ ]

71
00:05:10,230 --> 00:05:14,040
[ ♪ Don't wanna take my eyes off you, I'm going crazy over... ♪ ]

72
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:20,560
[ ♪ Oh, is your name Google? 'Cause you have all the answers ♪ ]

73
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:26,560
[ ♪ All my answers lead to you, I'm flustered because of... (you) ♪ ]

74
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:38,720
Hey, how do you know the dance? You don't even know them! Do you know them?

75
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,560
Do you know them? Yeah!

76
00:05:39,840 --> 00:05:40,860
Can you dance to it?

77
00:05:40,860 --> 00:05:42,960
Can you dance? Do you know this?

78
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:44,820
Jeng!

79
00:05:44,820 --> 00:05:47,270
Jeng!

80
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:49,540
Where's Jeng?

81
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:50,990
Jeng!

82
00:05:50,990 --> 00:05:54,680
We really... fucking...

83
00:05:57,440 --> 00:06:00,290
It's okay to cry.

84
00:06:00,290 --> 00:06:03,140
You've been exhausted for long enough...

85
00:06:03,140 --> 00:06:04,810
...Leader.

86
00:06:18,360 --> 00:06:25,400
[ ♪ Wanting to loop like this forever, can it be you? ♪ ]

87
00:06:25,400 --> 00:06:33,440
[ ♪ No matter how long the path, whatever day it is, it's still... you ♪ ]

88
00:06:35,640 --> 00:06:38,000
The fact that I like Jeng...

89
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:40,000
...is the truth.

90
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:45,020
[ ♪ I'll choose the path with you, every single time ♪ ]

91
00:06:45,020 --> 00:06:53,930
[ ♪ Stuck in a loop, so every day I wake up seeing those eyes ♪ ]

92
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,030
Hello, Hia Thien.

93
00:06:59,030 --> 00:07:02,970
I'm coming back. I can head back to see you today.

94
00:07:02,970 --> 00:07:03,760
Okay.

95
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:08,660
What about Master and Young Master Mai?

96
00:07:08,660 --> 00:07:10,000
What will Master do?

97
00:07:12,520 --> 00:07:15,440
I'm just a duck, aren't I?

98
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,780
Just a stone.

99
00:07:19,100 --> 00:07:22,890
I could never be a diamond like your brother dreamed of.

100
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:24,530
Yeah.

101
00:07:26,670 --> 00:07:29,110
I like Jeng.

102
00:07:30,280 --> 00:07:31,810
I've liked him for a long time.

103
00:07:31,810 --> 00:07:33,560
Nice to meet you.

104
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,010
Hope we see each other at the camp.

105
00:07:36,010 --> 00:07:39,340
I'm heading in for the audition first.

106
00:07:39,760 --> 00:07:44,450
I love how Jeng smiles when pursuing his dreams.

107
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:51,700
Is it so wrong...

108
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:56,040
...for me to love someone who completes what I'm missing?

109
00:08:00,300 --> 00:08:05,680
Are you insane?! How did you even get into my office?!

110
00:08:05,680 --> 00:08:07,650
Who's the insane one here?!

111
00:08:08,450 --> 00:08:10,220
What are you even talking about?!

112
00:08:10,220 --> 00:08:13,520
If you're drunk, go home and sleep! Don't come causing a scene in someone else's office!

113
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:17,220
It must feel so satisfying, ruining my life like this!

114
00:08:17,220 --> 00:08:19,880
What are you on about? What did I ever do to you?!

115
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:23,340
I'm disappointed.

116
00:08:23,340 --> 00:08:26,020
You had the nerve to do it, but not to own up to it!

117
00:08:26,440 --> 00:08:29,570
Where did that brilliant Bai Liu go?!

118
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:34,350
Must feel great, trampling all over my pride like this!

119
00:08:36,049 --> 00:08:38,360
Go ahead, do it! Do it!

120
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:40,740
Do it! Do it!
Thien!

121
00:08:41,179 --> 00:08:44,390
I'm just a nobody, a loser who can't compete with you!

122
00:08:44,450 --> 00:08:47,360
I love how Jeng laughs at the little things.

123
00:08:49,810 --> 00:08:52,160
In your eyes, Thien...

124
00:08:52,160 --> 00:08:56,820
...has Liu ever been a good person?

125
00:08:56,820 --> 00:09:04,000
Please... take me in and raise me, Khun Bai Liu.

126
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:23,390
[ ♪ It feels nice to shy away, don't wanna press further, this is enough to warm my heart ♪ ]

127
00:09:23,390 --> 00:09:32,530
[ ♪ Just keeping those feelings hidden, just listening from one side is enough ♪ ]

128
00:09:32,530 --> 00:09:34,700
Jeng...

129
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:38,840
Mai misses you.

130
00:09:40,560 --> 00:09:42,760
Are you Nong Mai?

131
00:09:43,380 --> 00:09:44,890
Yes, I am.

132
00:09:44,890 --> 00:09:48,170
Last night I saw a TikTok clip searching for someone, and...

133
00:09:48,170 --> 00:09:52,930
...my friend sent me a clip. I'm not sure if this is the person you're looking for.

134
00:09:52,930 --> 00:09:54,020
Whoa!

135
00:09:54,440 --> 00:09:55,800
Yes!

136
00:09:55,800 --> 00:09:58,990
Yes, it is! Where is your friend right now?!

137
00:09:58,990 --> 00:10:02,390
She's teaching kids up in Chiang Dao.

138
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:04,330
Chiang Dao?

139
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:07,490
Go on, Mai's friend.

140
00:10:07,490 --> 00:10:09,600
Go bring our other member back!

141
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:25,400
Boss

142
00:10:26,450 --> 00:10:30,680
I want to thank everyone who brought us to this point.

143
00:10:32,240 --> 00:10:33,320
We have a problem,Boss

144
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:36,600
The other agency, Kamikame, released a new song for a rookie artist

145
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:39,320
and it reached over 100,000 views within just one hour!

146
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:45,760
Woah, Boss! That company reached 100k views in less than an hour, while it took us a whole month.

147
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,480
Are we really gonna survive this, Boss?

148
00:10:49,040 --> 00:10:54,000
I don't think you need to hire a famous producer anymore.

149
00:10:54,960 --> 00:10:57,000
I think... I finally get it now.

150
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:01,640
Jeng...

151
00:11:02,200 --> 00:11:05,960
We can start over, Jeng.

152
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:09,680
Let's start over together again.

153
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:12,160
Start over?

154
00:11:12,160 --> 00:11:14,120
Gave all the money to your brother?

155
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:16,720
But the company is running out of money, Boss.

156
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:19,680
What are you going to do next, Boss?

157
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:24,440
We've poured so much into this, we can't stop halfway.

158
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:26,080
I'm just a duck

159
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:30,000
just a stone

160
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:33,440
You can't become the diamond your brother dreamed of.

161
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:40,000
But you're the one who reignited my passion again, you know?

162
00:11:40,520 --> 00:11:51,880
Can you answer me? Everything you did... was it to follow a dream, or was it because of me?

163
00:11:54,320 --> 00:12:00,120
The number you are calling is currently unavailable.

164
00:12:06,680 --> 00:12:08,360
Um... I like you, Jeng.

165
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,320
I've liked you for a long time.

166
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:14,320
Nice to meet you. I hope we'll meet at the agency.

167
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:18,280
I'm going to the audition now.

168
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:23,360
I believe in you. Mai, you can definitely do it.

169
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:27,200
Why don't we try having Mai make a TikTok video

170
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:29,120
asking people for help finding him?

171
00:12:29,120 --> 00:12:31,280
We're in the social media era anyway.

172
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:33,000
Maybe others can help look for him too.

173
00:12:35,040 --> 00:12:38,600
Yeah! Good idea!

174
00:13:25,360 --> 00:13:27,400
Jeng...

175
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:31,240
Mai misses you, Jeng.

176
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:05,520
We're here, young man! Por Doi Khoi Dao Village.

177
00:15:05,520 --> 00:15:07,000
How much is it, Uncle? I'll pay.

178
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,160
Uh, 120 baht.

179
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,920
Did you come alone, young man?

180
00:15:12,640 --> 00:15:16,640
Yes, sir.
- Oh, why didn't you bring your partner along?

181
00:15:16,640 --> 00:15:17,960
This place is super romantic! The weather is great,

182
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:22,720
with a cool breeze right under the mosquito net.
Great breeze all day and night!

183
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:28,520
Hello!
Welcome to Por Doi Khoi Dao Village!

184
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:30,440
My, what a handsome young man you are!

185
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:32,840
Thank You

186
00:15:33,320 --> 00:15:36,120
This village has a bamboo rafting project.

187
00:15:36,120 --> 00:15:38,640
Would you like to go rafting?

188
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:40,000
If you do, Uncle here can take you.

189
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:40,580
Sure! Let's head there right now.

190
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:44,400
Alright!

191
00:16:04,280 --> 00:16:05,600
What are you laughing at?

192
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,960
I suddenly felt shy.

193
00:16:15,160 --> 00:16:19,600
Jeng, don't go smiling like that at other people, okay?

194
00:16:19,680 --> 00:16:22,680
I'm jealous.

195
00:16:34,960 --> 00:16:37,960
Water...

196
00:16:54,200 --> 00:16:57,360
Alright, alright. We'll talk about it later then.

197
00:17:01,680 --> 00:17:05,760
Oh, what happened? How is it?

198
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:06,440
It's soaked

199
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:10,520
Oh, water got inside? Can it still work if water got in?

200
00:17:13,119 --> 00:17:16,520
If water got inside, it needs to be fixed.

201
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:23,079
Even if you get it fixed in Chiang Dao, it might not work.
Because the shop isn't big enough.

202
00:17:23,079 --> 00:17:25,520
They don't have all the spare parts. It's a waste of time having to order them from the city.

203
00:17:25,520 --> 00:17:26,020
Huh?

204
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:29,920
They have to order them from the city.
You'll have to order parts from the city, or send it to Chiang Mai.

205
00:17:31,600 --> 00:17:39,880
When I asked the shop,
they said the spare parts have to be ordered from Bangkok.

206
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:44,520
There are many steps involved, so it's going to take some time.

207
00:17:44,520 --> 00:17:51,280
So, what do you want to do? Do you want me to take it to be fixed for you?
If I take it to get fixed for you,

208
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:57,280
once it's done being repaired,
I'll bring it and leave it at the resort for you, okay?

209
00:17:57,280 --> 00:17:59,560
Alright.
Sound good?

210
00:18:27,440 --> 00:18:30,160
Hey kids, are you practicing dance?

211
00:18:30,160 --> 00:18:33,480
Yes, P', we're practicing for a school event.

212
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:36,560
Oh, did you choreograph it yourselves?

213
00:18:36,560 --> 00:18:38,920
We're just messing around, P', just having fun!

214
00:18:39,080 --> 00:18:41,400
Hey, do you know this group too?

215
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:43,800
Not really, P', but we saw it on TikTok.

216
00:18:44,280 --> 00:18:46,680
The song is cute, and my family grows bitter gourds too!

217
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:51,360
Practicing so hard, are you entering a competition?

218
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:58,920
There is a competition, P', but we don't care about the prize.
We just want to have fun with our friends.

219
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:02,640
That alone makes us happy.

220
00:19:05,000 --> 00:19:07,080
Just having fun is enough, right?
Yes!

221
00:19:07,080 --> 00:19:10,320
Come on, let me teach you the dance.

222
00:19:36,760 --> 00:19:40,000
You guys are doing great! Hope I was able to help.

223
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:42,440
Will you come help us again tomorrow, P'?

224
00:19:42,800 --> 00:19:48,400
Sure, I'll come help teach you dance again.
I'll meet you right here.

225
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:50,680
Are you tired yet? Tired?
We're tired now.

226
00:19:50,680 --> 00:19:56,160
Tired already? Then I'll head out first.
Bye-bye! Bye-bye!

227
00:19:56,160 --> 00:19:58,560
Bye.

228
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:03,280
What's your name, P'? So we can call you properly.

229
00:20:03,280 --> 00:20:04,840
My name is Jeng.

230
00:20:04,960 --> 00:20:11,800
P'Jeng! You're the coolest!
Bye-bye!

231
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:18,400
Circle around, switch fingers.

232
00:20:18,400 --> 00:20:18,920
Take your finger out.

233
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:22,920
Great job! Are you tired yet?

234
00:20:22,920 --> 00:20:25,400
P'Jeng, I'm tired. Can we take a break first?

235
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:31,600
Whoa, tired already?
Then let's sit and rest first, then dance more. Okay?

236
00:20:31,600 --> 00:20:34,920
P'Jeng is the coolest! When I grow up, I want to be cool like you.

237
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:36,560
Yeah, yeah, yeah!

238
00:20:37,920 --> 00:20:40,720
You guys are even cooler than me.

239
00:20:41,120 --> 00:20:44,000
Just seeing you dance makes me happy.

240
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,400
That's not true, I saw P'Jeng smiling.

241
00:20:46,240 --> 00:20:48,040
P'Jeng is happy too, right?

242
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,960
So, what do you guys usually do around here?

243
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:56,080
Don't you get lonely living here?
I don't see you playing on phones at all.

244
00:20:56,600 --> 00:21:01,720
Whoa, there's so much to do! Swimming, fishing, cycling, it's super fun!

245
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:06,560
Just tell P'Jeng that there's barely any cell signal here.

246
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:11,720
We don't have things like Bangkok kids do.

247
00:21:11,720 --> 00:21:14,360
But we have things Chiang Dao kids have!
- What's that?

248
00:21:14,520 --> 00:21:17,000
A Chiang Dao style smile!

249
00:21:25,760 --> 00:21:29,840
Alright, let's sit down and rest.
Yay!

250
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:33,320
Mai, we didn't tell P'Bai Liu or your brother,

251
00:21:33,320 --> 00:21:37,200
about you running away from the band. You can trust us.
- Thanks.

252
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:39,360
Is this Mai?

253
00:21:39,360 --> 00:21:40,840
Yes, it is.

254
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:47,240
Last night I saw a clip looking for someone on TikTok,
and then my friend sent me a clip.

255
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:49,440
I'm not sure if this is the person you're looking for.

256
00:21:49,440 --> 00:21:54,120
Whoa, yes, P'! Yes, it's him!

257
00:21:54,680 --> 00:21:59,920
Where is your friend now?
- My friend is teaching kids in Chiang Dao.

258
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:04,360
Chiang Dao?
Chiang Dao?

259
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:10,840
Whoa, what is he doing all the way over there?
What is he doing so far away?

260
00:22:10,840 --> 00:22:14,000
Or did he leave to become a monk and practice Dhamma on the mountain?

261
00:22:14,560 --> 00:22:21,400
Fleeing to the mountain waiting for someone to reconcile, this is literally 'A Tale of Thousand Stars'

262
00:22:23,640 --> 00:22:27,160
Dude, do you watch Y-series from every company, Fong?

263
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:30,800
Hey, or maybe Jeng traveled back in time?

264
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:35,000
Like 'Love Upon a Time Series', or maybe he has a bodyguard?

265
00:22:35,000 --> 00:22:37,480
I really can't with you, Fong.

266
00:22:37,480 --> 00:22:43,760
You should get your brain checked when you have free time.
You're getting crazier by the day.

267
00:22:43,760 --> 00:22:49,360
You're just like me.
- Gosh, what do we do now? If he leaves the band, what do we do?

268
00:22:49,360 --> 00:22:51,520
So what's next?

269
00:22:51,520 --> 00:22:52,960
I think I'll go tonight, P'.

270
00:22:53,040 --> 00:22:56,680
Tonight? You're not waiting until tomorrow?

271
00:22:56,680 --> 00:23:00,440
I can't wait any longer.Otherwise, I definitely won't be able to sleep.

272
00:23:06,250 --> 00:23:08,960
An important member,

273
00:23:08,960 --> 00:23:10,840
the person who made your dream come true.

274
00:23:11,320 --> 00:23:14,000
Mai, my son, go bring him back, okay?

275
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:18,360
P' and Thian will handle things here.
Don't worry.

276
00:23:18,360 --> 00:23:22,360
Once you two are back, we can push forward together.
Fight for it, son!

277
00:23:23,800 --> 00:23:28,480
I'll try contacting the rescue team staff.
In case they have his coordinates,

278
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:31,960
so we can find Jeng.

279
00:23:33,040 --> 00:23:36,760
Thank you so much, P' and everyone.

280
00:23:36,760 --> 00:23:38,680
Then let's prepare the work first.

281
00:23:39,440 --> 00:23:44,600
So when Jeng gets back, we'll be ready.
Alright, okay.

282
00:23:45,280 --> 00:23:46,880
Go bring your boyfriend back, okay?

283
00:23:56,600 --> 00:24:00,200
Just a moment, please.

284
00:24:02,720 --> 00:24:06,520
Your phone is repaired now.
I took it all the way to Chiang Mai to fix it.

285
00:24:06,520 --> 00:24:10,040
Thank you so much.

286
00:24:10,240 --> 00:24:13,560
Oh, you look so familiar, like the one they're looking for.

287
00:24:13,560 --> 00:24:15,360
Looking for what, ma'am?

288
00:24:15,480 --> 00:24:20,840
Looking for someone on this phone.
On TikTok.

289
00:24:20,840 --> 00:24:24,080
Here.
Looking for Jeng.

290
00:24:24,080 --> 00:24:27,360
Is your name Jeng?
- Yes, it is.

291
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:43,160
Smiling so widely, looking at a picture of your partner on the phone?

292
00:24:44,800 --> 00:24:48,000
No, ma'am, I was just worried the data on my phone might be lost.

293
00:24:48,120 --> 00:24:51,400
Thank you so much.
Should I transfer the repair fee to you now?

294
00:24:51,400 --> 00:24:59,280
No need. Earlier, I saw someone looking for you.
I think it might be your friend.

295
00:24:59,280 --> 00:25:01,000
My friend?

296
00:25:14,160 --> 00:25:15,400
Are we there, Uncle?

297
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:17,080
We're here, young man! Over this way.

298
00:25:18,760 --> 00:25:20,400
Is that the young man up ahead?
- Yes.

299
00:25:20,440 --> 00:25:27,320
I remember because he used my service before.
I dropped him off here two weeks ago.

300
00:25:27,320 --> 00:25:30,840
When his phone fell into the water, I took it to be fixed and delivered it back to him.

301
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:36,560
I saw him teaching local kids dance, so I remembered him.

302
00:25:36,760 --> 00:25:39,480
By the way, is it easy to find people here?

303
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:41,960
Oh, everyone in this village knows each other.

304
00:25:41,960 --> 00:25:46,560
Because the houses are all close together.

305
00:25:46,640 --> 00:25:48,160
Thank you so much.
You're welcome.

306
00:25:48,160 --> 00:25:49,200
Good luck!

307
00:25:52,360 --> 00:26:00,680
First move: point, switch sides.
Cross.

308
00:26:01,160 --> 00:26:07,960
Do this move three times.
Bring this up, cross.

309
00:26:10,200 --> 00:26:14,000
Left, right, crisscross like this.

310
00:26:23,040 --> 00:26:29,920
I want our time to slow down.
I still want Jeng by my side when I'm tired.

311
00:26:31,160 --> 00:26:35,200
Jeng, don't disappear from me again.

312
00:26:41,840 --> 00:26:46,800
I didn't disappear anywhere.
My time stopped moving,

313
00:26:46,800 --> 00:26:49,800
ever since I met Mai.

314
00:27:01,960 --> 00:27:11,560
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss! Kiss! Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!
Kiss! Kiss! Kiss!

315
00:28:11,600 --> 00:28:12,320
What are you doing?

316
00:28:12,320 --> 00:28:14,320
What are you sitting here doing all alone?

317
00:28:15,240 --> 00:28:22,020
Enjoying the view?
- Yeah, the view here is ridiculously beautiful.

318
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:24,480
And you ran off for a vacation without telling anyone.

319
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:27,200
If you told me, I could have come along.

320
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:31,280
What now? Should we take this chance to go on a honeymoon?

321
00:28:33,000 --> 00:28:39,760
I just ran off to heal my heart for a bit.
Didn't think it would become a big deal,

322
00:28:39,760 --> 00:28:42,000
to the point that you'd search all the way for me like this.

323
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:45,920
Well, Jeng is important to me.

324
00:28:49,400 --> 00:28:52,600
And then, your phone broke and you didn't tell us.

325
00:28:52,600 --> 00:28:57,880
Leaving everyone to worry like this, do you deserve a spanking?

326
00:28:57,880 --> 00:28:59,380
I don't know, it was so long ago.

327
00:28:59,920 --> 00:29:05,880
Do you deserve to be hit?
Do you deserve a spanking?

328
00:29:08,320 --> 00:29:09,880
Smile often, okay?

329
00:29:11,640 --> 00:29:13,280
But if it's a special smile,

330
00:29:13,280 --> 00:29:16,520
I hope it's for me alone.

331
00:29:19,240 --> 00:29:21,760
I'm saving it for a special person only anyway.

332
00:29:21,760 --> 00:29:24,640
For the one who went through the trouble to follow me all the way to Chiang Dao.

333
00:29:25,080 --> 00:29:28,180
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

334
00:29:33,240 --> 00:29:36,040
Why did you come here?

335
00:29:36,040 --> 00:29:39,000
Why did you come to Chiang Dao?

336
00:29:39,000 --> 00:29:40,030
Whoa!

337
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:45,760
We've been together for so long and you didn't know?
I'm originally from Chiang Mai.

338
00:29:45,760 --> 00:29:49,720
Hmph, I'm really hurt now.
- Really?

339
00:29:49,720 --> 00:29:53,960
Aw, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

340
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:54,460
I promise,

341
00:29:56,200 --> 00:29:59,760
after this, I'll pay more attention to the details.

342
00:30:06,320 --> 00:30:11,840
Tonight, you'll know why it had to be Chiang Dao.

343
00:30:35,240 --> 00:30:35,960
So refreshing!

344
00:30:35,960 --> 00:30:38,720
Makes me want to drink some too.

345
00:30:39,680 --> 00:30:42,800
Huh?

346
00:30:42,800 --> 00:30:46,800
Huh?
Huh?

347
00:30:46,800 --> 00:30:51,200
Huh?
Haha!

348
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:57,080
What?! Did you find Jeng?
Hey, hey, how is he doing? Is he safe and sound?

349
00:30:57,080 --> 00:31:04,120
He's fine, as cute as ever.
Right, so how are things with you guys? How's practice going?

350
00:31:04,120 --> 00:31:05,440
Whoa!

351
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:08,960
You two, please go ahead and rest up to the fullest!

352
00:31:08,960 --> 00:31:14,720
Don't worry about us over here at all.
We've got this totally under control.

353
00:31:14,720 --> 00:31:21,640
And guess what, we got Jun to join our team now, rest assured it's chill.

354
00:31:21,760 --> 00:31:29,320
And how's the atmosphere over there?
How is it today?
With this chilly weather, hey, it's so perfect!

355
00:31:29,320 --> 00:31:30,960
Or tonight will be...

356
00:31:31,560 --> 00:31:34,840
Who said something just now?
What about tonight?

357
00:31:36,160 --> 00:31:42,800
Yeah, don't pay any mind to him.
It's just the dog around here being jealous of you.

358
00:31:42,800 --> 00:31:47,120
It keeps barking alone because P'Sean won't accept its love.

359
00:31:47,120 --> 00:31:51,600
Alright, anyway, you two get plenty of rest.

360
00:31:51,800 --> 00:32:00,200
And don't forget to send pictures to show us off!
Yeah, yeah, see you guys!

361
00:32:01,000 --> 00:32:06,280
So, what's up with those two tonight?
Or maybe they'll...

362
00:32:06,280 --> 00:32:07,880
Hey, hey!

363
00:32:07,880 --> 00:32:12,600
Everyone, Mai sent a photo!
- Let me see, let me see!

364
00:32:12,600 --> 00:32:16,080
Whoa, whoa!
- So sweet!

365
00:32:16,080 --> 00:32:18,840
Yeah, super romantic!

366
00:32:20,360 --> 00:32:21,520
We have to go somewhere like this too!

367
00:32:23,080 --> 00:32:27,000
This romantic, I bet there's nothing left unsaid!

368
00:32:27,000 --> 00:32:31,880
Then I'll go be romantic with P'Sean instead,
I'm Out.

369
00:32:31,880 --> 00:32:33,310
He's so obsessed!

370
00:32:36,760 --> 00:32:39,480
I used my voice a bit too much earlier.

371
00:32:39,480 --> 00:32:39,980
Do you want to drink Ichitan?

372
00:32:40,720 --> 00:32:42,360
Yeah.

373
00:32:42,360 --> 00:32:45,520
Looks delicious.

374
00:32:48,440 --> 00:32:51,040
How is it?
- Fragrant!

375
00:32:51,040 --> 00:32:53,400
Awesome!
- It's good, right?

376
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:54,920
It's good!

377
00:33:00,360 --> 00:33:02,520
Oh, you're done taking a shower already?

378
00:33:02,520 --> 00:33:04,400
Why did it take so long?

379
00:33:04,840 --> 00:33:07,080
You smell so good too.

380
00:33:08,640 --> 00:33:12,520
If you don't believe me, try smelling it.

381
00:33:17,120 --> 00:33:19,440
You really smell good.

382
00:33:19,800 --> 00:33:21,920
Other parts smell good too.

383
00:33:21,920 --> 00:33:23,920
Naughty!

384
00:33:27,400 --> 00:33:32,280
Come to think of it...
The weather here is really cold, isn't it?

385
00:33:32,280 --> 00:33:35,800
Times like this, you need someone to cuddle.

386
00:33:36,800 --> 00:33:40,840
If it's cold, go cover yourself with a blanket. Cuddling me won't keep you warm.

387
00:33:40,840 --> 00:33:41,800
Who says so?

388
00:33:43,120 --> 00:33:45,280
Cuddling Jeng is warmer than a blanket.

389
00:33:45,280 --> 00:33:45,780
You're over exaggerating!

390
00:33:45,780 --> 00:33:47,780
OVER

391
00:33:53,680 --> 00:33:55,920
Seriously, the weather here is so good, right?

392
00:33:56,240 --> 00:33:58,480
And so refreshing too

393
00:34:01,840 --> 00:34:11,400
This place is called Ban Muang Khong.
I really like it. It's so peaceful.

394
00:34:11,400 --> 00:34:15,920
It made me reflect on many things.

395
00:34:15,920 --> 00:34:18,000
And was I one of those things?

396
00:34:19,679 --> 00:34:24,960
Of course, you always are.

397
00:34:25,199 --> 00:34:30,760
Since we crossed the mountain to get all the way here,

398
00:34:30,760 --> 00:34:32,040
Do we get to visit Jeng's home?

399
00:34:32,040 --> 00:34:32,880
Do you want to go?

400
00:34:34,000 --> 00:34:38,159
- Yeah.
- Sure, I'll take you there.

401
00:34:38,159 --> 00:34:43,000
Actually, there are lots of activities to do here.
I'll give you a tour myself, Mai.

402
00:34:43,000 --> 00:34:45,040
Really?
Mm-hmm.

403
00:34:45,040 --> 00:34:50,440
You won't drop my phone into the water, right?
- Are you teasing me?

404
00:34:50,440 --> 00:34:57,680
You said you'd tell me why you came to Chiang Dao,
but you haven't told me yet.

405
00:34:59,600 --> 00:35:03,040
Mai, take a look at the sky.

406
00:35:03,720 --> 00:35:06,520
Whoa!

407
00:35:06,520 --> 00:35:10,640
It's a completely different sky from Bangkok's.
- Right?

408
00:35:10,640 --> 00:35:13,080
Mm.

409
00:35:13,080 --> 00:35:14,360
But this place...

410
00:35:14,520 --> 00:35:22,540
made me realize,
how much time it takes for us to become a star.

411
00:35:28,080 --> 00:35:35,320
Before this, I admit that...
I was very ambitious.

412
00:35:35,320 --> 00:35:40,000
Ambitious to shine up there in the sky.
But...

413
00:35:40,000 --> 00:35:44,320
nothing turned out the way I hoped.

414
00:35:44,520 --> 00:35:51,680
I just comforted myself that...
it probably wasn't my time yet.

415
00:35:51,720 --> 00:35:59,680
I forgot that...
actually, every star has its own light inside.

416
00:35:59,680 --> 00:36:07,400
It's just that...
the sky hasn't opened up to welcome the new star yet.

417
00:36:07,400 --> 00:36:15,360
The sky here and the sky in Bangkok,
are actually showing the same stars.

418
00:36:15,480 --> 00:36:19,840
We just shouldn't extinguish their light, that's all.

419
00:36:24,040 --> 00:36:29,280
But Jeng...
you're a star that has never left my heart.

420
00:36:31,560 --> 00:36:37,480
You always shine brightly,
even when you stumble.

421
00:36:37,480 --> 00:36:44,320
Thank you, Jeng, for making me smile,
and for being my pillar of strength.

422
00:36:49,880 --> 00:36:54,960
The dew is falling. Let's go inside.
So you can get some rest soon.

423
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:57,280
We have early morning activities tomorrow.

424
00:36:57,280 --> 00:37:00,760
And aren't there any activities to do tonight?

425
00:37:01,760 --> 00:37:08,080
Naughty boy!
Come on, hurry.

426
00:37:25,280 --> 00:37:29,400
What's wrong? Are you nervous?

427
00:37:29,400 --> 00:37:30,760
Nervous about what?

428
00:37:31,200 --> 00:37:35,000
No, no, I'm not nervous.

429
00:37:35,600 --> 00:37:42,000
It's just that tonight is the first night,
that the two of us get to sleep together.

430
00:37:42,000 --> 00:37:48,600
We sleep together normally all the time,
it's nothing.

431
00:37:50,080 --> 00:37:53,840
So do you want to sleep together in a non-normal way?

432
00:37:57,120 --> 00:38:01,920
Naughty! I'm going to sleep now.

433
00:38:05,200 --> 00:38:09,440
But Jeng, your heart is beating really fast.

434
00:38:11,000 --> 00:38:13,800
Beating even faster than when you were practicing dancing.

435
00:38:13,800 --> 00:38:15,360
Should I give you CPR then?

436
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:22,640
Why CPR? I'm not drowning or anything.

437
00:38:22,640 --> 00:38:26,720
You sure look like someone who's drowning.

438
00:38:28,480 --> 00:38:31,600
Why do you keep making my heart flutter?

439
00:38:32,020 --> 00:38:34,100
Do you want your heart to flutter even more?
